{"query": "everyone we all know the world is shifting towards sustainability but let's be honest actually living a sustainable lifestyle is difficult as a consumer if you want to go eco friendly you face three major barriers products are often significantly overpriced they are hard to find inverse of scattered across dozens of random websites it creates massive decision fatigue and a lack of trust you want to buy green but you don't know who is actually verified and who is just greenwashing the demand is there this is a 150 billion dollar global market but the buying experience is Broken Angel Broking E-Commerce platform that solve this by offering a single trusted source for verified products we are not created Marketplace we target urban millennials And Gen Z consultancy cities in Pakistan who values sustainability but demand convenience we offer a transparently source the range of products from reusable bamboo kitchenwares and sustainable fashion accessories we operate on a direct to consumer DTC model powered by shopify which allows us to scale rapidly with low overhead are unit economics are already showing strong potential or average order value 35 dollars we operate with the healthy gross margin of approximately 40% most importantly our customer acquisition cost is just $7 and 50 Cents against the lifetime value of 856 is driven by a mix of revenue streams which includes direct product sales subscription based Eco kids to drive revenue and bundle packages we have a clear path to profitability in your one project 420000 in revenue with net profit scaling to 2.5 million dollars in revenue with the net profit of 800000 within just 14 18 months a road map includes expanding beyond Pakistan into the middle east and South Asia personalisation to further increase growth we are seeking 250000 in seed funding in exchange for 15% equity value at 1.67 million to become sustainability we have the unit economics chapter 1 by you to join us in making sustainable living accessible affordable installation thank you", "event": "smart_rag_search_activated", "timestamp": "2026-01-15T12:27:57.073655Z", "level": "info"}
